  "source": "# Mermaid diagrams\n\n## Request flow\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    Browser --> Vite\n    Vite --> GoAPI[\"Go API & renderer\"]\n    click Browser href \"https://example.com/\" \"Open example\"\n```\n\n## Page load\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User\n    participant App\n    participant Server\n    User->>App: Open nested document\n    App->>Server: GET /api/page\n    Server-->>App: Rendered Markdown\n```\n\n## Document modes\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --> Source\n    Source --> Preview: toggle\n    Preview --> Source: toggle\n```\n\n## Git graph\n\n```mermaid\ngitGraph\n    commit id: \"boot\"\n    branch experiment\n    checkout experiment\n    commit id: \"feature\"\n```\n\n## Syntax error fallback\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    A --> B\n    B --> [broken\n```\n",
